Z||000006||MrFieroUK||11-03-2001||01:55 PM||||Hugh - sorry  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> as you've guessed that was a typo - 6,200+ rpm.<P>Dave Gunsul. You said the "new" manifold would go right over the Dizzy - is that the new Upper Manifold? I would like to know if someone has mated an aluminim head lower manifold and fuel rail assy. to the existing intermediate/upper FIERO manifold :confused||||reg||5
